<% canonical = "https://smarts.md#{@chain.path}" %>
<% reference = "chains/#{@chain.slug}" %>

# <%= @chain.name %>

- **Chain ID:** `<%= @chain.chain_id %>`
- **Tier:** <%= @chain.full? ? "live" : "docs-only" %>
- **Contracts:** <%= @chain.contract_count %>
<% if @chain.docs_url.present? %>
- **Docs:** <%= @chain.docs_url %>
<% end %>

<%= @chain.summary %>

<% if @chain.docs_only? %>
> Indexed source, ABI, and contract references.
<% else %>
> This is a live chain on Smarts. Contract pages can surface live on-chain state, recent activity, and governance.
<% end %>

## Query via AI agent

- **MCP endpoint:** `https://smarts.md/mcp`
- **Reference:** `<%= reference %>`
- **Sample prompt:** "Show me the supported contracts on <%= @chain.name %> and summarize the highest-signal ones."

## Contract breakdown

<% @chain.top_kinds(8).each do |kind, count| %>
- **<%= kind %>:** <%= count %>
<% end %>

## Contracts

<% @chain.contracts.each do |contract| %>
- **<%= contract.name %>** (`<%= contract.kind %>`) - `<%= contract.address %>`<% if contract.slug.present? %> - [canonical page](<%= contract.path %>)<% end %>
<% end %>

## Links

- Canonical page: <<%= canonical %>>
<% if @chain.docs_url.present? %>
- External docs: <%= @chain.docs_url %>
<% end %>
